OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 06 AUG
OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1965FThe BBC pulls The War Game from
OL,7,Fits schedule.
OL,8,
OL,9,FThe drama-documentary, by director
OL,10,FPeter Watkins, depicting the events of
OL,11,Fa fictional nuclear attack on the
OL,12,FUnited Kingdom, was part of the
OL,13,FWednesday Play strand. The BBC move
OL,14,Fcame as a result of pressure from the
OL,15,FBritish government.
OL,16,
OL,17,FThe film was eventually televised on
OL,18,F31st July 1985, ahead of the 40th
OL,19,Fanniversary of the Hiroshima bombing,
OL,20,Fand the day before a repeat screening
OL,21,Fof Threads.
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
