OL,5,
OL,6,CG1970FEdward II airs on BBC Two.
OL,7,
OL,8,F1969 Edinburgh Festival production from
OL,9,Fthe Prospect Theatre Company and
OL,10,Freworked for the BBC. Recorded at
OL,11,FPiccadilly Theatre.
OL,12,
OL,13,FFeatures first same-sex kiss on British
OL,14,Ftelevision between Ian McKellan
OL,15,F(Edward) and James Laurenson (Piers
OL,16,FGaveston).
OL,17,
OL,18,CG1979FThe first edition of Kick Start
OL,19,Fairs on BBC One.
